sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Review platform
    participant C as Connector
    participant API as FastAPI service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NLP as Local NLP models
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Flash

    P->>C: official-shaped payload
    C->>API: normalised review
    API->>DB: store raw + normalised review
    API->>NLP: sentiment, department, embedding
    NLP-->>API: scores + 384-d vector
    API->>API: compute reputation-risk (0-100)
    API->>DB: store review analysis

    Note over API,LLM: Three-pass detection over negative and mixed reviews
    API->>LLM: Pass A, extract problem + specifics
    LLM-->>API: summary, department, specifics
    API->>LLM: Pass B, consolidate into canonical types
    LLM-->>API: dynamic issue taxonomy
    API->>LLM: Pass C, assemble issue + description
    LLM-->>API: evidence-grounded issue
    API->>DB: upsert issue by cluster_key + evidence links
